# Database Rules

## Design

- Flat relational tables + FKs; avoid deep nested JSON for core relations
- Index FKs and entitlement/access hot paths
- Include `app_id` on tenant-scoped tables
- Prefer cursor pagination over unbounded collect

## Migrations

- Every schema change has a migration
- Expand/contract for safe deploys
- Document rollback notes for risky migrations
- Never break existing entitlement/order history

## Money tables

- Unique constraints preventing duplicate payments/entitlements/reward txs
